Distinguish the cases in `hLc : 0 ≤ locConst D.host.E D.R.r w (epsLev D.host.E D.host.d l.M w)`. Combine the equalities or inequalities in the displayed calculation. Rewrite using `[supConst, ENNReal.ofReal_mul hLc]`. Expand and normalize the polynomial expressions, which then agree. Rewrite `h1` using `[ENNReal.ofReal_of_nonpos (le_of_lt (not_le.mp hLc)), zero_mul]`.

